  "design_notes": [
    "One entry serves both stage votes: first_stage_propellant_t and upper_stage_propellant_t are the two capacity columns.",
    "contracts are the \"Shown for contracts\" column: XS \"C0, C1 small builds\", S \"C0–C2, C8\", M \"C1–C5, C8\", L \"C3–C8\", XL \"C5–C7\". The design does not define \"small builds\"; XS is listed for C0 and C1.",
    "The table has no strengths, drawbacks, cost, lead time or twin. Tank cost is not given anywhere, which leaves the cost multiplier of 7.10 without a base (open question 11 in data/README.md).",
    "category_params holds the structural ratios (kerolox 0.05, methalox 0.06, hypergolic 0.06, hydrolox 0.10), game values from real ranges per section 19. No ratio is given for solid propellant: the Solid Kick Motor carries a fixed load and ignores this vote.",
    "The failure model (8.4) ties pogo to a \"long first stage\", but the design does not say which sizes count as long, so no tank carries pogo_oscillation or the pogo suppression test."
  ],
